==English==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|anti|toxin|lang=en}}.
[[Category:English words suffixed with -toxin]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
{{wikipedia}}

# {{lb|en|immunology}} An [[antibody]] that is capable of neutralising specific toxins that are causative agents of disease.

